{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/extras/034a3642ade96dae31e67df330f75006.avif?t=1754298316\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Save the desolate island of Vindilis.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Omniscient, lord of the island, has descended into madness and unleashed the four plagues upon the people who rebelled against him. Play as Fury and embark on an epic quest for vengeance across the island of Vindilis, accompanied by your sword and your sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vindilis is a classic 2D action-adventure game set on a desolate island. Traverse five hand-drawn levels, defeat your enemies, and face powerful bosses to save Vindilis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/extras/6ba113fd889499c7d0b7e4f472067e43.avif?t=1754298316\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A classic 2D action game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay inspired by Souls-like games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn art direction in a unique pencil-style </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 levels to explore and 5 bosses to face</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short and intense experience (approximately 1 to 2 hours of gameplay)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905740?t=1754298316","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/eb10ff77e43106983dc73de799ab222b8933e3ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754298316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905740/674d04297d8715f4fdc14c220a12db6c3fd0d299/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754298316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c